             "copies/kg263bn9176#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Pencil, read from the lower (180-degree) panel. Day, month and year each closed by a point. The middle figure of the roll number is an open two-stroke 4, so the number reads 343. No name or initials in the crop."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
